What I’d actually do with these accounts: Don’t just follow all of them and let the algorithm bury everything.

Make one private List called something like “Builders / Growth / Web3”. Then whenever someone posts something useful, save only one of four things:

a tool
a workflow
a growth tactic
a product idea

After a month, you’ll have a much better idea bank than another folder full of “AI news.”
That’s the real reason I like following people who are still actively building in public.

